    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48508" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tŏmyris</span></b> , is,
			f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τόμυπις,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a Scythian
			queen</i>, <i>by whom the elder Cyrus was defeated and
				slain</i>, <i><span class="en">Just. 1, 8</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Tib. 4, 1,
				143</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Val.
					Max. 9, 10</span></i>, ext. 1.—Called also
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tămyris</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tămĭris</span></b> , <i><span class="en">Front.
				Strat. 2, 5</span></i>; and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Thămyris</span></b> , <i><span class="en">Val. Max. 9,
				10</span></i>.</div>
